    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present no.274 Galtymore Road. This fine 2 bed mid terrace house comes to the market in great condition throughout, sure to catch the eye of first time buyers or investors alike.\r\n\r\nNumber 274 is surrounded by a host of local amenities to include many shops, parks, cafes and is also right on the Luas line which makes access to and from the City Centre as convenient as it can be.\r\n\r\nWalking through the front door you are immediately met with warm, homely tones. A cosy living room to the front and towards the rear a fully fitted kitchen completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nTo the rear you have a sunny and private back garden with a lovely decking area, a fantastic space to catch some rays on those long summer days.\r\n\r\nUpstairs you have two double bedrooms, one to the front and one to the rear. A fully tiled family bathroom completes this property.\r\n\r\nAs previously mentioned this property has great public transport links. Several bus routes run throughout the area. The M50 motorway is also only a short drive away which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis property will fly, so early viewing would be recommended to see everything this property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Great condition\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Private back garden\r\n- Local amenities\r\n- Public transport links"
      },
      {
